{title: God the Father Be Our Stay}
{artist: Martin Luther · tr. Richard Massie}
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 100}

Verse 1
God the Father, be our Stay, When hell's dread pow'rs assail us;

Verse 2
Jesus Christ be Thou our Stay,

Verse 3
Holy Ghost, be Thou our Stay,

Verse 4
1(alt). Triune God, be Thou our Stay,

Chorus
Cleanse us from our sins, we pray, Nor in our last hour fail us. Keep us from the
Evil One; Firm in the faith abiding, In Christ our Savior hiding,
And heartily confiding. Let us put God's armor on: With all true Christians
running Our heav'nly race and shunning The devil's wiles and cunning.
Amen, Amen, this be done, So sing we, Hallelujah!
